# Project rules

- Project name is File Processing.
- Backend is FastAPI; frontend is currently a browser dashboard served by FastAPI.
- Keep existing `/api/v1/files/*` endpoints compatible when extending functionality.
- Write tests for API behavior changes and run `pytest -q`.
- Do not commit SQLite databases, original uploaded files, tokens or `.env`.
- Processing is currently synchronous, local-only and unauthenticated. Never present it as production secure.
- Add typed document schemas and deterministic validation before implementing AI extraction and OCR.
- Use short-lived feature branches and pull requests. Do not force-push to `main`.
